! brief-common.md — brief, 2026-10-26

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/research/i2-relay/brief-common.md` (brief, file date 2026-10-26); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/research/i2-relay/index]].

